  ],
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "verse-001",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 1,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-chronicles:3:1",
      "numberLabel": "1",
      "text": "Now these were the sons of David, which were born unto him in Hebron; the firstborn Amnon, of Ahinoam the Jezreelitess; the second Daniel, of Abigail the Carmelitess:",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Chronicles 3:1",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-chronicles:3:1"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-002",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 2,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-chronicles:3:2",
      "numberLabel": "2",
      "text": "The third, Absalom the son of Maachah the daughter of Talmai king of Geshur: the fourth, Adonijah the son of Haggith:",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Chronicles 3:2",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-chronicles:3:2"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-003",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 3,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-chronicles:3:3",
      "numberLabel": "3",
      "text": "The fifth, Shephatiah of Abital: the sixth, Ithream by Eglah his wife.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Chronicles 3:3",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-chronicles:3:3"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-004",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 4,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-chronicles:3:4",
      "numberLabel": "4",
      "text": "These six were born unto him in Hebron; and there he reigned seven years and six months: and in Jerusalem he reigned thirty and three years.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Chronicles 3:4",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-chronicles:3:4"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-005",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 5,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-chronicles:3:5",
      "numberLabel": "5",
      "text": "And these were born unto him in Jerusalem; Shimea, and Shobab, and Nathan, and Solomon, four, of Bathshua the daughter of Ammiel:",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Chronicles 3:5",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-chronicles:3:5"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-006",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 6,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-chronicles:3:6",
      "numberLabel": "6",
      "text": "Ibhar also, and Elishama, and Eliphelet,",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Chronicles 3:6",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-chronicles:3:6"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-007",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 7,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-chronicles:3:7",
      "numberLabel": "7",
      "text": "And Nogah, and Nepheg, and Japhia,",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Chronicles 3:7",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-chronicles:3:7"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-008",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 8,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-chronicles:3:8",
      "numberLabel": "8",
      "text": "And Elishama, and Eliada, and Eliphelet, nine.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Chronicles 3:8",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-chronicles:3:8"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-009",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 9,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-chronicles:3:9",
      "numberLabel": "9",
      "text": "These were all the sons of David, beside the sons of the concubines, and Tamar their sister.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Chronicles 3:9",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-chronicles:3:9"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-010",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 10,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-chronicles:3:10",
      "numberLabel": "10",
      "text": "And Solomon’s son was Rehoboam, Abia his son, Asa his son, Jehoshaphat his son,",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Chronicles 3:10",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-chronicles:3:10"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-011",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 11,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-chronicles:3:11",
      "numberLabel": "11",
      "text": "Joram his son, Ahaziah his son, Joash his son,",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Chronicles 3:11",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-chronicles:3:11"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-012",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 12,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-chronicles:3:12",
      "numberLabel": "12",
      "text": "Amaziah his son, Azariah his son, Jotham his son,",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Chronicles 3:12",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-chronicles:3:12"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-013",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 13,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-chronicles:3:13",
      "numberLabel": "13",
      "text": "Ahaz his son, Hezekiah his son, Manasseh his son,",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Chronicles 3:13",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-chronicles:3:13"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-014",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 14,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-chronicles:3:14",
      "numberLabel": "14",
      "text": "Amon his son, Josiah his son.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Chronicles 3:14",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-chronicles:3:14"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-015",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 15,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-chronicles:3:15",
      "numberLabel": "15",
      "text": "And the sons of Josiah were, the firstborn Johanan, the second Jehoiakim, the third Zedekiah, the fourth Shallum.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Chronicles 3:15",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-chronicles:3:15"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-016",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 16,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-chronicles:3:16",
      "numberLabel": "16",
      "text": "And the sons of Jehoiakim: Jeconiah his son, Zedekiah his son.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Chronicles 3:16",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-chronicles:3:16"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-017",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 17,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-chronicles:3:17",
      "numberLabel": "17",
      "text": "And the sons of Jeconiah; Assir, Salathiel his son,",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Chronicles 3:17",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-chronicles:3:17"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-018",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 18,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-chronicles:3:18",
      "numberLabel": "18",
      "text": "Malchiram also, and Pedaiah, and Shenazar, Jecamiah, Hoshama, and Nedabiah.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Chronicles 3:18",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-chronicles:3:18"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-019",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 19,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-chronicles:3:19",
      "numberLabel": "19",
      "text": "And the sons of Pedaiah were, Zerubbabel, and Shimei: and the sons of Zerubbabel; Meshullam, and Hananiah, and Shelomith their sister:",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Chronicles 3:19",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-chronicles:3:19"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-020",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 20,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-chronicles:3:20",
      "numberLabel": "20",
      "text": "And Hashubah, and Ohel, and Berechiah, and Hasadiah, Jushabhesed, five.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Chronicles 3:20",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-chronicles:3:20"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-021",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 21,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-chronicles:3:21",
      "numberLabel": "21",
      "text": "And the sons of Hananiah; Pelatiah, and Jesaiah: the sons of Rephaiah, the sons of Arnan, the sons of Obadiah, the sons of Shechaniah.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Chronicles 3:21",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-chronicles:3:21"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-022",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 22,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-chronicles:3:22",
      "numberLabel": "22",
      "text": "And the sons of Shechaniah; Shemaiah: and the sons of Shemaiah; Hattush, and Igeal, and Bariah, and Neariah, and Shaphat, six.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Chronicles 3:22",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-chronicles:3:22"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-023",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 23,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-chronicles:3:23",
      "numberLabel": "23",
      "text": "And the sons of Neariah; Elioenai, and Hezekiah, and Azrikam, three.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Chronicles 3:23",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-chronicles:3:23"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-024",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 24,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-chronicles:3:24",
      "numberLabel": "24",
      "text": "And the sons of Elioenai were, Hodaiah, and Eliashib, and Pelaiah, and Akkub, and Johanan, and Dalaiah, and Anani, seven.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Chronicles 3:24",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-chronicles:3:24"
      }
    }
  ],
  "source": {
